<section class="hero hero-post hero-page">
  <div class="hero-inner container hero-post-inner">
    <div class="hero-kicker">LINKS · <%= date(new Date(), 'YYYY') %></div>
    <h1 class="hero-title hero-post-title"><%= page.title %></h1>
  </div>
  <svg class="hero-wave" viewBox="0 0 1440 110" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M0,62 C240,100 460,18 740,44 C1000,68 1220,24 1440,56 L1440,110 L0,110 Z" fill="#ddd0b8"/>
    <path d="M0,78 C260,108 520,38 800,60 C1040,78 1250,44 1440,70 L1440,110 L0,110 Z" fill="#f8f3e8"/>
  </svg>
</section>

<div class="sheet">
  <div class="container page-wrap">
    <div class="links-intro"><%- page.content %></div>

    <div class="friend-grid">
      <% (site.data.links || []).forEach(function (link, i) { %>
        <a class="friend-card" href="<%- link.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="friend-index"><%= String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0') %></span>
          <span class="friend-avatar"><% if (link.avatar) { %><img src="<%- link.avatar %>" alt=""><% } else { %><%= link.name.trim().charAt(0).toUpperCase() %><% } %></span>
          <span class="friend-main">
            <strong><%= link.name %></strong>
            <em><%= link.desc %></em>
            <small><%= link.url.replace(/^https?:\/\//, '').replace(/\/.*$/, '') %></small>
          </span>
          <span class="friend-arrow">↗</span>
        </a>
      <% }) %>

      <a class="friend-card friend-empty" href="https://github.com/Nihaoa-ui" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <span class="friend-avatar">＋</span>
        <span class="friend-main">
          <strong>这里还空着</strong>
          <em>想交换友链的话，来 GitHub 找我</em>
          <small>github.com/Nihaoa-ui</small>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <section class="friend-note">
      <div>
        <h3>交换友链</h3>
        <p>写博客、还在更新、内容不要太杂就行。去 <a href="https://github.com/Nihaoa-ui" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a> 找我，附上站名、简介和链接就行。</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>本站信息</h3>
        <p>名称：不吃香菜<br>简介：数学系大一的 Go 后端笔记<br>链接：<a href="https://nihaoa-ui.github.io">nihaoa-ui.github.io</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
